00:12:16.620 --> 00:12:18.620
There's a variety of animals that live in the water.

00:12:19.270 --> 00:12:21.970
Some, like whales, sea lions, and dolphins, are mammals.

00:12:22.310 --> 00:12:23.310
Just like you and me.

