00:12:28.550 --> 00:12:30.000
And sea mammals can do something.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:36.080
things that fish never dreamed of did you know that whales can sing and dolphins whistle squeak

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:41.230
and chirp to communicate sea mammals are warm-blooded animals they take care of each other

00:12:41.230 --> 00:12:47.700
and mothers nurse their young i guess you could say that they're not cold fish when a dolphin

